/// M32 HISTORY-087 "unavailable target fails closed without host contact".
/// Source: tests/host-discrimination/adapters/storage.test.ts.
/// Related fixture: tests/host-discrimination/adapters/storage.ts (fake host + adapter).
/// Disposition: RETAIN. Availability fail-closed is live in the delivered reviewed
/// adapter: host/adapters/storage.ts inherits the availability guard verbatim and the
/// conformance suite pins zero host calls when unavailable.
/// Protects: unavailable target fails closed without host contact; operations localGet,
/// localRemove, localSet; expected leaves storage::unavailable; no host contact or wire send.
/// Variants: all values/host faults enumerated in this declaration (unavailable get+set+remove here).
/// Environment: Bun prototype test environment; requires bun-prototype-env. Logical gates
/// N1, N2, BROWSER and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none. Execution credit: NOT claimed (if_retained_accept_after P23).
/// Case storage/unavailable-fails-closed checks: get-unavailable, set-unavailable, remove-unavailable, no-host-contact.
